mythicos-update (1.0.6) aurora; urgency=medium

  * Right after the login another process often holds the APT lock (system
    services, the tray icon's own first check). The package lists refresh now
    waits and retries for about a minute instead of failing at once, the tray
    icon and the window take turns instead of colliding, and the tray icon
    treats a busy package manager as "try again later", not as an error.
    The message names the process holding the lock.

 -- Studio Hastag <contact@hastag.fr>  Wed, 18 Nov 2026 14:50:00 +0100

mythicos-update (1.0.5) aurora; urgency=high

  * Fix: APT progress is no longer requested on fd 1 (APT::Status-Fd=1).
    That made the maintainer scripts of some packages lose their standard
    output and fail ("sed: couldn't close stdout: Bad file descriptor",
    "echo: I/O error"), leaving the package half-configured. The progress is
    now sent on a dedicated pipe, so the progress bar keeps working.

 -- Studio Hastag <contact@hastag.fr>  Wed, 18 Nov 2026 14:30:00 +0100

mythicos-update (1.0.4) aurora; urgency=medium

  * History window: the package rows of an entry are now created only when it
    is expanded, and at most 150 entries are listed. With a long APT history
    the window used to freeze for a long time while building thousands of
    rows. Errors while displaying the history are logged and shown in the
    window instead of taking it down.

 -- Studio Hastag <contact@hastag.fr>  Tue, 17 Nov 2026 21:05:00 +0100

mythicos-update (1.0.3) aurora; urgency=medium

  * Package list refresh: repository failures are listed once each (APT
    reports the same item several times) and python-apt's raw warning dump
    is no longer printed.

 -- Studio Hastag <contact@hastag.fr>  Tue, 17 Nov 2026 20:55:00 +0100

mythicos-update (1.0.2) aurora; urgency=medium

  * Flatpak step: a download that prints nothing (large runtime, output not
    on a terminal) is no longer mistaken for a stalled update. The stall
    detection now looks at the read/write activity of the flatpak process
    in addition to its output.

 -- Studio Hastag <contact@hastag.fr>  Tue, 17 Nov 2026 20:45:00 +0100

mythicos-update (1.0.1) aurora; urgency=medium

  * Refreshing the package lists no longer fails when only some
    repositories fail (e.g. a PPA answering 503): the failures are logged and
    ignored. It still fails, with the per-repository details, when nothing
    could be fetched. Same fix for the automatic updates.

 -- Studio Hastag <contact@hastag.fr>  Tue, 17 Nov 2026 20:30:00 +0100

mythicos-update (1.0.0) aurora; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: GTK 4 / libadwaita window, separate XApp tray icon,
    APT and Flatpak updates installed through pkexec, password-less refresh
    through a sudoers rule, self-update first, interrupted-install repair,
    update history, optional automatic updates (off by default),
    MythicOS release upgrade detection through mythicos-upgrade-info.

 -- Studio Hastag <contact@hastag.fr>  Sun, 15 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100
